mb|P|mb|P|mb|1N|mb|P2C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I disagree with 2@C. You should only bid 2@C if you have at least an invitational hand. When you have a weak hand with 5-4 in the majors, simply transfer to your 5-card suit. Here is the reason. Suppose I bid 2@D. Now if North bids 2@S, that shows an invitational hand with 5 spades and 4 hearts. And that is not what North holds.|
