UP|52|nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BNorth: ^*NHoward do you play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?ndf=crawlingstayman,Crawling Stayman^*N|CP||FP||at|?|
