mb|P|mb|1D|mb|2C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@C over 1@D is one of my favorite bids. It makes it much more difficult for responder, here East, to bid. And in fact, even on this hand East has only flawed choices. 2@H is a bit of an overbid as it should show 10+ points (and 5+ hearts) whereas had North passed, East has an easy 1@H bid. I think 2@H is aggressive but reasonable with a 6-card suit with ace and king in partner's suit.|
