nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|4S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|4@S is the weakest bid because playing 2/1 there is a bidding principle known as ^*BFast Arrival^*n. That means, when you are in a game forcing auction, if you jump to game rather than making cheaper bids you are ^*BArriving Fast^*n and show a very weak GF.|
