mb|P|mb|1D|mb|P|mb|2C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@C is a very good bid. Many players, at this situation, would incorrectly bid 1@H. But, with clubs and a major and a game forcing hand, you should bid 2@C to establish a game force first.|
