mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|East should bid 2@S in case partner has 4 spades. 2@S is not a |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=reverses,Reverse^*N|CP||FP||at| after a game force has been established. It is simply bidding out your shape, looking for a major suit fit.|
