nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|East should bid 2@S in case partner has 4 spades. 2@S is not a reverse after a game force has been established. It is simply bidding out your shape, looking for a major suit fit.|
